direction: right
Apps: Applications {shape: rectangle}
Agents: Telemetry agents {shape: rectangle}
Collector: OpenTelemetry collector {shape: hexagon}
Metrics: Metrics store {shape: cylinder}
Logs: Log store {shape: stored_data}
Traces: Trace store {shape: cylinder}
Dashboards: Dashboards {shape: page}
Alerts: Alert manager {shape: rectangle}
OnCall: On-call engineer {shape: person}
Apps -> Agents: telemetry
Agents -> Collector
Collector -> Metrics
Collector -> Logs
Collector -> Traces
Metrics -> Dashboards
Logs -> Dashboards
Traces -> Dashboards
Metrics -> Alerts: rules
Alerts -> OnCall
